{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-settings-nav-collapse#card-zh","repo":"meng-114/dsh-settings-nav-collapse","commit":"d3edd84eac20aac0e5dceca346cf15f0814370f9","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-collapse 是一款 DSH Web 设置面板插件：在面板标题栏加入导航折叠按钮，将左侧导航收窄为图标轨道，给手机等窄屏留出更多正文空间。它根据视口宽度默认选择折叠或展开，并记住用户手动选择；没有可用图标时改用保留文字的紧凑导航。窄屏正文可滚动，极窄屏还能横向查看较宽设置内容。适合经常在手机或小窗口调整 DSH 设置的用户；需要安装到 DSH Web 客户端，无需额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:438-530","client.js:180-262"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-settings-nav-collapse#card-en","repo":"meng-114/dsh-settings-nav-collapse","commit":"d3edd84eac20aac0e5dceca346cf15f0814370f9","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-settings-nav-collapse adds a toggle to the DSH web settings panel, narrowing its navigation to give content more room on small screens. It remembers manual choices, keeps labels when icons are missing, and lets narrow content scroll or pan. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:438-530","client.js:180-262"]}
