{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-settings-nav-collapse#feature-toggle","repo":"meng-114/dsh-settings-nav-collapse","commit":"d3edd84eac20aac0e5dceca346cf15f0814370f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-collapse 的功能「toggle」：设置面板标题栏提供折叠切换按钮，可在展开与窄导航间切换；按钮状态反映实际应用状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:510-530","client.js:533-544"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-settings-nav-collapse#feature-viewport","repo":"meng-114/dsh-settings-nav-collapse","commit":"d3edd84eac20aac0e5dceca346cf15f0814370f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-collapse 的功能「viewport」：插件按 640px 视口断点默认折叠窄屏导航、展开宽屏导航；用户点击后保存选择，并优先沿用手动设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:31-33","client.js:120-156","client.js:471-475"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-settings-nav-collapse#feature-fallback","repo":"meng-114/dsh-settings-nav-collapse","commit":"d3edd84eac20aac0e5dceca346cf15f0814370f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-collapse 的功能「fallback」：折叠时若导航按钮没有内联 SVG 图标，插件使用保留文字的紧凑布局，避免只显示空白图标栏。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:258-270","client.js:300-314"]}
{"unit_id":"meng-114__dsh-settings-nav-collapse#feature-mobile","repo":"meng-114/dsh-settings-nav-collapse","commit":"d3edd84eac20aac0e5dceca346cf15f0814370f9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-settings-nav-collapse 的功能「mobile」：窄屏时设置内容区域可独立滚动；极窄屏的设置内容获得较宽画布，可横向平移查看。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:180-262"]}
